  (offsets 0/4/8; EAX proven = FUN_00437F70 return on both normal getter paths; write values proven by the esp
  ledger + slot dataflow to be f32(f80(-(int32_in[i])))). EAX_PROVENANCE_AT_0x458E2C = FUN_00437F70_RETURN.
